      "message": "The reason that I reverted the previous solution where \"-coverage\" is added to feature directly in bp2build is that the extra profile lib added on bazel side can\u0027t be individually controlled, so we may run into the situation where a module having the coverage disabled through \"-coverage\" but the extra lib is still linked, in which case the extra lib can\u0027t find profile utility libs that are added by clang when coverage is enabled.",
